**1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
**2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns.

